Source: gsgpy_70_5_3SO.pdf — page 5.

The earliest example of a computer-generated seismic attribute was used to display reflector dip and continuity. This was developed by Picou and Utzman in 1962. Source: gsgpy_70_5_3SO.pdf — 5.

