The timeline illustrates the development of seismic attributes in relation to key advances in seismic exploration technology from the 1960s to beyond 2000. It highlights the introduction of digital recording of seismic data, seismic data in color, the concept of seismic attributes, seismic inversion, complex trace analysis, response attributes, crossplotting of attributes, classification of attributes, pattern recognition, neural network analysis, texture attributes, and multiattribute analysis.

